---- MODULE space_unassigned__toggle__invariant_non_boolean ----
EXTENDS Integers
VARIABLES x, y
vars == <<x, y>>
Assign(a, b) == x = a /\ y = b
Same(a, b) == a = a /\ b = b
Init == x = 0
Next == x' = x /\ y' = IF y = 0 THEN 1 ELSE 0
Inv == 1
====

